B.fEP=new A.kt("What is ThanqYou?","ThanqYou is a social platform where you can:\n\n- Chat and make calls with your contacts\n- Watch and create short video reels\n- Earn real money just by watching reels\n- Share your talent and grow a following\n- Get your earnings paid directly to your bank account\n\nThanqYou is built for the Indian market with support for all Indian languages.")
B.fEJ=new A.kt("How to use a referral code","You can enter a referral code during signup to link your account to your friend's.\n\nSteps:\n1. On the signup screen, look for the \"Referral Code\" field\n2. Enter the code shared by your friend\n3. Complete your signup\n\nThere is no signup bonus for either of you - instead, once you stay active for 15 days, watch 5+ hours, and complete KYC, your friend starts earning a bigger share of their viewer earnings because of you. It's not a flat one-time reward, it's an ongoing boost to their real earnings.\n\nYour referral code is shown in your wallet screen. Share it with friends to earn more!\n\nNote: Referral code can only be entered at the time of signup. It cannot be added later.")
B.eDr=s([B.fEP,B.fEJ],t.g9)
B.fEW=new A.uC(B.lQ,"Getting Started",B.bc,B.eDr)
B.fEN=new A.kt("How to start a chat","Starting a chat is simple:\n\n1. Go to the Chats tab (bottom navigation)\n2. Tap the pencil/compose icon at the top right\n3. You will see your contacts who are on ThanqYou\n4. Tap any contact to open a chat\n5. Type your message and hit send\n\nYou can also send photos, videos, voice messages, GIFs and emojis.\n\nNote: Only contacts saved in your phone who have ThanqYou will appear in the list.")
B.fEU=new A.kt("Why can't I find someone to chat with?","If you cannot find a contact in your chat list, here are the possible reasons:\n\n1. They have not signed up on ThanqYou yet\n   ? Invite them using your referral code\n\n2. Their number is not saved in your phone contacts\n   ? Save their number and restart the app\n\n3. They may have a different number on ThanqYou\n   ? Confirm which number they registered with\n\n4. App permissions issue\n   ? Go to Phone Settings ? Apps ? ThanqYou ? Permissions ? Allow Contacts")
B.fER=new A.kt("Message not delivering","If your message is not being delivered, check the following:\n\n1. Internet connection\n   ? Make sure you have an active internet connection (WiFi or mobile data)\n\n2. Message status icons\n   ? Single tick = sent from your device\n   ? Double tick = delivered to recipient's device\n   ? No tick = still sending (check your internet)\n\n3. The recipient may be offline\n   ? Messages will be delivered once they come online\n\n4. Try restarting the app\n   ? Close and reopen ThanqYou\n\nIf the issue persists, contact us at support@thanqyou.com")
B.eC4=s([B.fEN,B.fEU,B.fER],t.g9)
B.fEY=new A.uC(B.lb,"Chat & Calls",B.nI,B.eC4)
B.fEK=new A.kt("How to post a reel",'To post a reel on ThanqYou:\n\n1. Go to the Social tab\n2. Tap the + (Create) button at the bottom\n3. Select "Reel" from the options\n4. Record a video or pick one from your gallery\n5. Add a caption (optional)\n6. Tap Post\n\nYour reel will appear on the For You feed of other users.\n\nTips for better reach:\n- Keep videos under 180 seconds\n- Use good lighting\n- Add an interesting caption')
B.fEO=new A.kt("How your earnings are calculated","There is no daily cap on ThanqYou - watch, create, and engage as much as you like.\n\nYour earnings are paid by ThanqYou based on your activity relative to everyone else that day - the more you genuinely use the app, the bigger your share.\n\nEarnings are calculated fresh every day and paid to your bank once your account is verified and your balance crosses the payout threshold.")
B.eFS=s([B.fEK,B.fEO],t.g9)
B.fEZ=new A.uC(B.pR,"Reels & Social",B.KM,B.eFS)
B.fET=new A.kt("When do earnings unlock?",'Your earnings are calculated fresh every day, based on that day\'s activity, and added straight to your balance the next day - there is no separate "locked" waiting period.\n\nOnce your account is verified (KYC) and your balance crosses the minimum payout threshold, your earnings are paid to your bank automatically on a monthly basis.\n\nThis means your earnings are always real money, credited straight to your ThanqYou wallet.')
B.fEL=new A.kt("How to add money to wallet",'You can top up your ThanqYou wallet anytime:\n\n1. Go to the Wallet tab\n2. Tap "Add Money"\n3. Enter the amount\n4. Choose your payment method (UPI, card, net banking)\n5. Complete the payment\n\nAdded money goes directly to your Available Balance and can be used immediately.\n\nMinimum top-up: Rs 10\nMaximum top-up: Rs 10,000 per transaction')
B.fEI=new A.kt("How to withdraw earnings","Withdrawals on ThanqYou are automatic once you qualify - there's no manual \"withdraw\" step:\n\n1. Complete KYC verification first (Aadhaar or Passport)\n2. Add your bank account details in the Wallet tab\n3. Once your balance crosses the minimum threshold, it's paid out automatically\n\nMinimum withdrawal: Rs 500\nPayouts are released on a monthly basis.\nKYC is required to protect your account and comply with RBI guidelines.")
B.ehf=s([B.fET,B.fEL,B.fEI],t.g9)
B.fEV=new A.uC(B.DG,"Wallet & Earnings",B.L9,B.ehf)
B.eb7=new A.ae(62589,"MaterialIcons",null,!1)
B.fEQ=new A.kt("Why KYC verification is needed","KYC (Know Your Customer) verification is required only for withdrawals.\n\nWhy we need it:\n- To verify your identity before sending money to your bank\n- To comply with RBI and government regulations\n- To protect you from fraud and unauthorized withdrawals\n\nWhat you need:\n- Aadhaar Card OR Passport\n- The name on the document must match your signup name\n\nKYC is NOT required to:\n- Chat or make calls\n- Watch reels and earn\n- Post reels\n- Use the Social tab")
B.fEM=new A.kt("How to change profile photo",'To update your profile photo:\n\nFor Chat profile:\n1. Go to Settings (top right in Chats tab)\n2. Tap your profile picture at the top\n3. Choose "Take photo" or "Upload from gallery"\n4. Crop and confirm\n\nFor Social profile:\n1. Go to Social tab ? Your Profile\n2. Tap "Edit Profile"\n3. Tap your avatar\n4. Choose a new photo from gallery\n\nChanges apply immediately.')
B.fES=new A.kt("How to delete your account",'To permanently delete your ThanqYou account:\n\n1. Go to Settings\n2. Tap Account\n3. Scroll down to "Delete Account"\n4. Read the warning carefully\n5. Confirm with your phone number\n6. Tap "Delete"\n\nWhat gets deleted:\n- Your profile and all personal data\n- All your chats and messages\n- Your social posts and reels\n- Your wallet balance (non-refundable)\n\nThis action is permanent and cannot be undone.\n\nIf you just want a break, consider logging out instead.')
B.eC0=s([B.fEQ,B.fEM,B.fES],t.g9)
